r Auto-Repair</a>:</b> This item has a small percentage chance to cast a <a href=\"/page/Reconstruct\" title=\"Reconstruct\">Reconstruct</a> spell on you when you take damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">DR</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 30/Adamantine</b>: Reduces  physical damage by 30, except from Adamantine attacks.</span></span> 30/Adamantine</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Maker%27s_Touch\" title=\"Maker&#39;s Touch\">Maker's Touch</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Maker%27s_Touch\" title=\"Maker&#39;s Touch\">Maker's Touch</a>:</b> Casting a <a href=\"/page/Repair_spells\" title=\"Repair spells\">Repair spell</a> on yourself or allies leaves a lingering defensive buff that increases the <a href=\"/page/AC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AC\">AC</a> and <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical Resistance Rating</a> of your target by +3 for 12 seconds.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-o