lot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Winter\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Winter</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Eminence_of_Winter\" title=\"Named item sets\">Eminence of Winter</a>:</b> <span style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>2 Pieces Equipped: +30 Artifact bonus to Physical Resistance Rating</li><li>3 Pieces Equipped: +30 Artifact bonus to Healing, Repair, and Negative Amplification</li><li>4 Pieces Equipped: +10% Legendary bonus to maximum hitpoints</li><li>5 Pieces Equipped: +100% Artifact bonus to Threat Generation</li><li>6 Pieces Equipped: +3 Artifact bonus to Constitution</li><li>7 Pieces Equipped: +15% Artifact bonus to Armor Class</li></ul></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a